idmefv2_category_mapping.csv

Tier-2 category mapping used by bin/idmefv2-connector.py: translates an
explicit "Category"/"category" value coming from the triggering alert/search
into a valid IDMEFv2 V08 category, when that value isn't already one.

Columns:
  source_value      - the raw category/search-name value to match (case-insensitive)
  idmefv2_category  - the IDMEFv2 V08 category to emit; rows with a value not in
                      the V08 categoryEnum are ignored

Administrators can add rows for additional legacy or custom category values
without changing the connector's code. If no row matches, the connector falls
back to keyword matching on the raw event text, then to "Other.Undetermined".
